BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Amazing Magic Mel
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260810T150000
UID:69fcde43703c336300261cee@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Find your "inner magic" with the Amazing Magic Mel during this
  upbeat\, hilarious\, and interactive magical experience. Expect a healthy
  dose of participation and self-empowerment as she leads aspiring magician
 s of all ages on a journey to become "official magicians" during this fast
 -paced\, comedy magic show for the entire family.\nSpace is limited. Ticke
 ts will be given out 30 minutes prior from the main desk at Swansea Memor
 ial branch.\nWith thanks to the Swansea Town Hall for funding this special
  event and providing the room.
LOCATION:Swansea Memorial\, Rousseau Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/69fcde43703c336300261cee
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
