DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260602T150000
UID:69bd72df491b809c6f21d42c@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:In this session\, the benefits and impacts of screen time will
  be explored. Discussion will include looking at recommendations for scree
 n time per age of the child (between 0 and 6 years of age) and how to mode
 l and manage appropriate screen time behaviour. Physical activity recommen
 dations as an alternative to screen time will be reviewed.
LOCATION:Fort York\, Program Room\, Ground Floor
